maybe it's my just impression, but I don't see that much.

66
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:36,680
我是说，当然，即便在科学界内部，科学家们表达出的观点也大不相同。
I mean, of course, I have to say that even among the scientific
communities, there are quite different opinions expressed by scientists.

67
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:42,640
有些科学家仅仅是为人工智能在科学研究中的新可能性感到兴奋。
Some scientists are just fascinated by the new possibility of AI deployment in the scientific research.

68
00:07:42,990 --> 00:07:58,116
但有些科学家则认为，人类科学家在科学知识的产出中几乎没有什么贡献了，
所以我们必须大幅偏离对科学研究的传统理解。
But some scientists say that, you know, there is nothing, almost nothing human scientists can actually contribute to the production of
scientific knowledge so we have to diverge from the conventional understanding of scientific research quite dramatically.

69
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:15,300
所以观点差异很大，但我没看到那种真正聚焦于重
新审视科学研究本质以及科学家自身真实性的讨论。
So there are lots of difference in opinions but I don't quite see that kind of discussion actually focused on the re-examination of
the nature of scientific research and the authenticity of scientists themselves.

70
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:20,220
