you know, the technologies, the kind of technologies I just mentioned,
that improve the transparency and interpretability of complex AI models.

72
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:39,140
我认为，这些可以有助于提升人工智能在科学领域的应用效果。
I think, you know, that can contribute to, you know, improving the impact of the AI in science.

73
00:08:39,789 --> 00:08:49,732
因为这样一来，人工智能学习到的概念会更符合人类的认知，
从而让科学家更好地理解模型内部发生了什么。
Because that way, the concepts AI learned would be more aligned with humans, and
then that way scientists will better understand what's going on inside the AI models.

74
00:08:49,838 --> 00:09:01,680
这样当出现错误结论时，比如某个假设行不通，人
类科学家就能轻易识别出这是人工智能的失败模式。
and then when there is a wrong conclusion, such as you know, the hypothesis that's not going to work, then, you know,
human scientists will easily know that that's the failure mode of AI.

