00:09:03,694 --> 00:09:04,740
第一位，请讲，布莱恩。
One, yes please Brian.

76
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:15,000
是的，我想强调一下我之前的观点，即人工智能和科学——我的意思是，
科学在很大程度上是知识的追求。
Yeah I and I'm gonna double down on what I said earlier is is that AI and
science, I mean, science is very much, I think, the pursuit of knowledge.

77
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:19,580
